# --- Which model (LR or RF) x which feature set (LG-selected or RF-selected) wins? ---
# df_monthly_sample's negatives are a DETERMINISTIC pick (first/last day per
# county-month), not the fixed-probability random sample the rest of the notebook
# uses -- so the section 3/10 case-control intercept/weight correction (built for a
